}>">getServerSideProps</data-lsp></span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> (</span><span>async</span><span> (<data-lsp lsp="(parameter) context: GetServerSidePropsContext<ParsedUrlQuery, PreviewData>">context</data-lsp>) </span><span>=&gt;</span><span> {</span></p><p><span>  </span><span>return</span><span> {</span></p><p><span>    <data-lsp lsp="(property) props: {
